<title>CROATIA: Croatian March trade deficit shrinks to $330 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatian March trade deficit shrinks to $330 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE   MARCH  JAN-MARCH  FEBRUARY MAR '96</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	 -330	-845	-346    -232</p>
<p> Exports			    339     1,196	 373     401</p>
<p> Imports			    669     2,041	 719     633</p>
<p>NOTE -- The January-March rise in exports was put at 10.5 percent compared to the same period of 1996. Imports rose 22.8 percent in the first quarter on an annual basis. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
